WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.934
We're tracking the latest

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.335
developments out of Ukraine.

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.570
Overnight, explosions

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:03.970
were heard

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.705
throughout the capital of Kiev

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.874
and other Ukrainian cities and regions.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:08.641
As authorities said

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.810
there was a countrywide air attack.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:11.611
This is fierce.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:12.846
Fighting has continued around

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:13.546
that embattled

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:14.647
eastern city of BUK

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:15.815
moves that we have been telling you

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:17.317
about for several months now.

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:18.752
Ukraine has been gaining

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.687
some ground there in recent days.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:22.088
And CNN has obtained

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.323
new satellite imagery

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:25.425
that shows just the devastating toll

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:27.260
that fighting has taken on the city

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.928
over the last year alone.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:30.063
This all is happening

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:31.464
as Ukraine is preparing for that

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:33.233
long awaited counteroffensive

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.034
to reclaim

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:34.834
occupied land

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.170
that Russia took when it invaded Ukraine.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.705
With us now to talk more about

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:39.672
this is retired U.S.

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:41.074
Army Major Mike Lyons.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:42.609
Thank you, of course, for being here.

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.010
So we're talking about mood,

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.211
which is this key city

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:46.379
that they've been fighting over.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:47.580
We talked about last week

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.982
with the Russian mercenaries

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:49.482
and whether or not

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:50.884
they were going to withdraw.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:51.651
This image

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:54.220
right here is so striking to me.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.289
This is back about a year ago

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.858
and it just looks completely towards

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:01.461
what happened, exactly what weapons

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:03.530
were used to take it from this

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:05.565
to this Kaylen example of, you know,

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.399
Russian war crime.

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:08.635
This is a thermobaric weapon fired

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.303
firebombing fundamentally weapons

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:11.304
that are designed to do nothing

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:13.073
but cause fire and destruction here

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:14.174
against civilian targets.

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:15.508
This was a civilian apartment

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:16.876
building, an apartment complex here.

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:17.610
You could see

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.845
the entire vegetation

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:19.913
it is gone on both side

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:21.181
and on this side here.

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.248
The buildings are destroyed.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:23.683
This is just one example

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:25.385
of many other examples of the Russians

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:26.486
using weapons

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:27.554
against civilians that they shouldn't

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:28.254
be doing.

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:28.988
So that's something that

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.824
they would never typically use in an area

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:31.691
where you can see

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:33.660
homes, you can see parks. Right.

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.728
And we saw in apartment buildings

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:36.362
and other places

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.397
where there's other examples

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:38.498
of the thermobaric weapons

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:39.632
there's a certain kind of system

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:40.834
that they've brought to the battlefield.

00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:41.868
It's not even controlled

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:43.503
by the Russian army strategically.

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:44.637
It was brought in

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:45.638
by the senior leaders

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:47.440
of the Russian military in order to

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:48.908
to create a weapon of terror

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.243
for the civilians in that area.

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:51.511
Just all of

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:52.412
this is

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:53.580
what makes people wonder

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.548
about the Ukrainian counteroffensive

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:56.616
that we've been talking about,

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.017
which was expected to happen

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.053
I believe, in the spring.

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:01.020
There's now big questions

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:01.754
about what exactly

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:02.622
that's going to look like.

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:03.323
I mean, obviously, now

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:04.591
we're here through mid-May.

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:05.358
What's your sense?

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:06.726
So I think there's a pause

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:07.961
taking place rightfully

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:09.762
so as the Ukraine military

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:10.997
is training its troops

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:11.898
overseas, places

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:12.866
like grass in

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:14.200
places like the United States

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.869
has to put its weapons in place

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:17.303
in order for the counter-offensive

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:18.071
to be effective

00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:20.373
the commander has the option of both

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:21.274
where it takes place

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:22.442
and when it takes place.

00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:24.210
So if you look at this very long

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:24.878
border here

00:02:24.878 --> 00:02:26.079
between where Russian troops are

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:27.614
and where the Ukrainian troops are,

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:29.315
I think the counter-offensive

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:30.316
when it finally happens

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:32.152
kind of cuts in this way

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:34.988
and threatens Crimea until the Ukraine

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:36.156
military can threaten

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:38.525
what Russia is doing in the south here.

00:02:38.525 --> 00:02:39.359
The Russian military

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:40.093
is not going to stop.

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:41.928
So you think it's more towards

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:43.029
the south and the east?

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:43.429
I do.

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:44.030
And I think there's

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:44.931
a little bit of a faint

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:45.565
taking place

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:47.200
right now and disinformation

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:48.568
for what's going on.

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:50.737
The ballot box is a classic example

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:51.804
of Ukraine resilience

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:53.339
and Russian military failure

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:54.974
and is feeding into that narrative.

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:56.009
But it also will show

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:57.577
that if the Russians put too much effort

00:02:57.577 --> 00:02:58.411
towards that,

00:02:58.411 --> 00:02:59.712
the Ukraine will turn around

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.014
and kind of cut their forces

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:02.148
kind of in half here

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:03.750
and really threaten Crimea.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:04.784
And as you know, President

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.152
Biden is in Japan right now.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.587
He's meeting with G7 leaders.

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:07.887
Obviously,

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:08.922
Ukraine is going to be one

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:11.090
of the top topics they're talking about.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.559
The White House is coming under pressure

00:03:12.559 --> 00:03:14.661
once again for the F-16 fighter jets

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:16.329
that are made by Lockheed Martin.

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:18.231
To provide them to Ukraine.

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:19.332
What's your sense of whether or not

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:20.233
they're going to give on that?

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:21.401
I don't think they're going to give it

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:22.635
still a long time frame.

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:23.469
18 months

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:24.938
in order to get them to the battlefield

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:26.673
for them to be effective, to train pilots

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:28.675
and also for the logistics supply chain.

00:03:28.675 --> 00:03:29.642
They need helicopters.

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:30.910
They need ways to move troops

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.178
around the battlefield quickly.

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:32.779
I think

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:34.414
besides the artillery, the air defense

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:35.281
and the armor systems

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:36.316
that have been given to them,

00:03:36.316 --> 00:03:37.350
you bring helicopters

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:38.418
to that counteroffensive

00:03:38.418 --> 00:03:38.785
right now

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:40.220
would allow shock effect

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:40.920
that allow troops

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.422
to move around the battlefield, cross

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:43.489
over that the Dnipro River

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:44.424
crossed those obstacles

00:03:44.424 --> 00:03:45.325
that we have there

00:03:45.325 --> 00:03:46.559
I think that this

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:47.994
conversation gets tabled again.

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:50.063
So those are the arguments against

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:50.663
sending them

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:52.031
the time it would take to train

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:52.799
and to get them there.

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:53.266
And, you know,

00:03:53.266 --> 00:03:54.033
how long it would take before

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:54.934
they could actually use them.

00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:56.970
What's the argument for sending the F-16?

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:57.136
Well,

00:03:57.136 --> 00:03:59.205
it sends a signal to the Russians

00:03:59.205 --> 00:04:00.573
that the European community,

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:01.341
we've seen the Brits

00:04:01.341 --> 00:04:03.076
and then the Dutch have already said that

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:03.776
they're willing to send

00:04:03.776 --> 00:04:04.110
the Belgians

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:04.410
have said

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.446
that they would like to train the pilots

00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:07.380
and do things with them.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.015
So it's a more of a strategic weapon.

00:04:09.015 --> 00:04:10.283
The bottom line is

00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:10.984
this is leading more

00:04:10.984 --> 00:04:12.452
and more to Ukraine,

00:04:12.452 --> 00:04:14.220
likely becoming a member of NATO

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:15.121
at some point, three or four

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:16.022
or five years down the line

00:04:16.022 --> 00:04:16.990
when this is all over.

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:17.991
All right, Major, big lines.

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:18.791
Thank you for that update.

00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:19.492
It's good to see that

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:19.892
and to see

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:20.994
just that striking image

00:04:20.994 --> 00:04:23.296
once again of black mode before

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:24.631
and after and seeing what

00:04:24.631 --> 00:04:25.832
Russia has done. Thank you.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.102
Ukraine says Russia launched

00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:30.703
several waves of missile attacks

00:04:30.703 --> 00:04:32.939
overnight from air, land and sea.

00:04:33.039 --> 00:04:33.573
The country's

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:34.274
air fuel says

00:04:34.274 --> 00:04:37.143
29 of the 30 missiles were intercepted.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:38.478
At least one person

00:04:38.478 --> 00:04:40.046
was killed in a missile strike

00:04:40.046 --> 00:04:42.382
in the southern port city of Odessa.

00:04:42.382 --> 00:04:43.716
On the front lines in the east

00:04:43.716 --> 00:04:45.451
fierce fighting is being reported

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:46.152
in back mud

00:04:46.152 --> 00:04:47.120
where the head of the Volga

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.354
mercenary group claims

00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:50.023
his fighters have edge forward

00:04:50.023 --> 00:04:52.191
inside the battered city.

00:04:52.191 --> 00:04:53.192
CNN's Clare Sebastian

00:04:53.192 --> 00:04:54.661
is following these developments.

00:04:54.661 --> 00:04:54.761
Clare,

00:04:54.761 --> 00:04:55.695
quite a lot of activity

00:04:55.695 --> 00:04:56.562
there, aerial attacks

00:04:56.562 --> 00:04:57.163
that you were telling me

00:04:57.163 --> 00:04:58.665
about across the country,

00:04:58.665 --> 00:05:02.435
as well as a potential news from back up.

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:03.202
But it's very difficult

00:05:03.202 --> 00:05:04.370
to know the veracity of these.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:05.305
Yeah, so we've seen

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:06.572
what the Ukrainians are now saying

00:05:06.572 --> 00:05:08.174
is the ninth overnight aerial

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:09.642
assault from Russia in the month of May.

00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:10.910
So clearly there's an uptick there.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.378
This while it was less

00:05:12.378 --> 00:05:13.513
concentrated than what

00:05:13.513 --> 00:05:13.880
we saw

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:14.380
on Monday night

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:17.150
into Tuesday with that huge attack.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:17.784
This was sort of

00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:18.685
waves of attacks

00:05:18.685 --> 00:05:19.419
happening over the course

00:05:19.419 --> 00:05:20.553
of about 7 hours.

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:21.821
They say, according to the officials,

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:22.255
coming there

00:05:22.255 --> 00:05:23.356
from different directions

00:05:23.356 --> 00:05:24.691
so this backs up the assertion

00:05:24.691 --> 00:05:25.758
that we had from a U.S.

00:05:25.758 --> 00:05:26.793
official earlier this week, that

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:27.627
this is not just about

00:05:27.627 --> 00:05:28.861
exhausting Ukraine's

00:05:28.861 --> 00:05:30.697
air defenses on Russia's part,

00:05:30.697 --> 00:05:32.532
but also trying to confuse them,

00:05:32.532 --> 00:05:33.299
bringing in missiles

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:34.467
from all different directions.

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:36.636
We understand that in the Kiev region,

00:05:36.636 --> 00:05:37.970
no missiles got through.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:40.206
They do report fragments and debris.

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:41.074
And that, of course,

00:05:41.074 --> 00:05:43.109
has its danger in itself in Odessa.

00:05:43.109 --> 00:05:44.610
The the regional command

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.712
there is now clarifying

00:05:45.712 --> 00:05:46.813
that it was actually debris

00:05:46.813 --> 00:05:48.681
that hit this industrial facility

00:05:48.681 --> 00:05:49.982
and killed one person.

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:51.351
So that is sobering.

00:05:51.351 --> 00:05:52.785
Even when air defenses are activated,

00:05:52.785 --> 00:05:54.454
there is still significant danger.

00:05:54.454 --> 00:05:55.755
They also say they shot down

00:05:55.755 --> 00:05:57.590
a couple of drones over in Beirut,

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:58.691
know different weapons.

00:05:58.691 --> 00:05:59.892
This is land based fighting,

00:05:59.892 --> 00:06:00.393
but a similar

00:06:00.393 --> 00:06:02.095
sort of attritional strategy

00:06:02.095 --> 00:06:03.062
that we're seeing from Russia.

00:06:03.062 --> 00:06:03.596
They continue,

00:06:03.596 --> 00:06:04.430
according to the Ukrainians,

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:05.798
to bring in new units

00:06:05.798 --> 00:06:07.100
into battle with Prigozhin,

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:08.768
the head of Wagner, now claiming

00:06:08.768 --> 00:06:10.403
that they took some 260

00:06:10.403 --> 00:06:12.105
meters of territory

00:06:12.105 --> 00:06:13.106
in the last day,

00:06:13.106 --> 00:06:14.307
presumably within the city.

00:06:14.307 --> 00:06:15.508
Ukrainians say they're advancing

00:06:15.508 --> 00:06:16.809
from the outskirts.

00:06:16.809 --> 00:06:17.710
And we've got some images

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:18.010
that I want

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:18.778
to show you,

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:19.979
some new satellite images

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:21.848
that show really the cost

00:06:21.848 --> 00:06:23.282
of this ongoing battle.

00:06:23.282 --> 00:06:25.818
This is a school, school number 12.

00:06:25.818 --> 00:06:27.920
This is in the western districts of Baku,

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:28.888
when you can see on the left

00:06:28.888 --> 00:06:31.090
in May last year and on the right

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:31.691
this month,

00:06:31.691 --> 00:06:32.992
pretty much wiped off the map.

00:06:32.992 --> 00:06:34.761
It looks like ruins.

00:06:34.761 --> 00:06:36.429
So that is that's really what's going on.

00:06:36.429 --> 00:06:37.630
These are heavily contested areas.

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:38.564
This is the theater

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:40.733
just to the west of the river.

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:41.601
We believe that scenario

00:06:41.601 --> 00:06:43.403
that was taken over by

00:06:43.403 --> 00:06:44.837
Russian forces earlier on

00:06:44.837 --> 00:06:46.439
and possibly sort of end of March,

00:06:46.439 --> 00:06:47.306
beginning of April.

00:06:47.306 --> 00:06:47.940
That theater

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.242
also destroyed their shops

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:50.443
to the right of it

00:06:50.476 --> 00:06:51.677
that you see also destroyed

00:06:51.677 --> 00:06:53.146
so that gives you a sense

00:06:53.146 --> 00:06:55.114
of the kind of fighting buildings

00:06:55.114 --> 00:06:57.750
collapsing destruction in Bermuda.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:58.751
No one is giving up.

00:06:58.751 --> 00:06:59.819
Russia, as I say, continues

00:06:59.819 --> 00:07:01.320
to bring in new units

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:02.488
Sebastian, thank you so much.

